Hi, Kafka Team.

I am testing the new rebalance protocol of KIP-848. It seems that the KIP-8=
48 protocol works well in KRaft mode. However, KIP-848 protocol does not wo=
rk well in `Zookeeper` mode.=C2=A0

=C2=A0

I have created two versions of docker-compose files for Zookeeper Mode and =
KRaft Mode. And I tested KIP-848 using the same consumer code and settings.

=C2=A0

In KRaft Mode, the consumer received the assignment correctly. However, an =
error occurred in Zookeeper Mode.

=C2=A0

*Is KIP-848 supported in Zookeeper mode? or only KRaft is supported?*=C2=A0

=C2=A0

