Hi Chris,

> Wouldn't ValueToKey [1] be applicable as well, for example?
Yes, also that one can be affected.

On Wed, May 8, 2024 at 5:59=E2=80=AFPM Chris Egerton <chrise@aiven.io.inval=
id>
wrote:

> Wait, just one more thing--are there any other SMTs that could benefit fr=
om
