Kamal Chandraprakash created KAFKA-16696:
--------------------------------------------

             Summary: Remove the in-memory implementation of RSM and RLMM
                 Key: KAFKA-16696
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-16696
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Task
            Reporter: Kamal Chandraprakash
            Assignee: Kamal Chandraprakash


The in-memory implementation of RSM and RLMM were written to write the unit/integration tests: [https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/10218]

This is not used by any of the tests and superseded by the LocalTieredStorage framework which uses local-disk as secondary storage and topic as RLMM.



--
