> h4. Assignor Selection
> The group coordinator has to determine which assignment strategy must be =
used for the group.=C2=A0The group's members may not have exactly the same =
assignors at any given point in time - e.g. they may migrate from an assign=
or to another one for instance. The group coordinator will chose the assign=
or as follow:
>  * A client side assignor is used if possible. This means that a client s=
ide assignor must be supported by all the members. If multiple are, it will=
 respect the precedence defined by the members when they advertise their su=
pported client side assignors.
>  * A server side assignor is used otherwise. If multiple server side assi=
gnors are specified in the group, the group coordinator uses the most commo=
n one. If a member does not provide an assignor, the group coordinator will=
 default to the first one in=C2=A0{{{}group.consumer.assignors{}}}.



