Jos=C3=A9 Armando Garc=C3=ADa Sancio created KAFKA-16767:
--------------------------------------------------

             Summary: KRaft should track HWM outside the log layer
                 Key: KAFKA-16767
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-16767
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
          Components: kraft
            Reporter: Jos=C3=A9 Armando Garc=C3=ADa Sancio


The current implementation of KRaft tracks the HWM using the log layer impl=
ementation. The log layer has an invariant where the HWM <=3D LEO. This mea=
n that the log layer always sets the HWM to the minimum of HWM and LEO.

This has the side-effect of the local KRaft reporting a HWM that is much sm=
aller than the leader's HWM when the replica start with an empty log. E.g. =
a new broker or the kafka-metadata-shell.



