Luke Chen created KAFKA-16781:
---------------------------------

             Summary: Expose advertised.listeners in controller node
                 Key: KAFKA-16781
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-16781
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
            Reporter: Luke Chen


After [KIP-919|https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-919%3A+Allow+AdminClient+to+Talk+Directly+with+the+KRaft+Controller+Quorum+and+add+Controller+Registration], we allow clients to talk to the KRaft controller node directly. But unlike broker node, we don't allow users to config advertised.listeners for clients to connect to. Without this config, the client cannot connect to the controller node if the controller is sitting behind NAT network while the client is in the external network.



--
