Re-opening as 3.6 backport is still missing

> InvalidRequestException: ADD_PARTITIONS_TO_TXN with version 4 which is no=
t enabled when upgrading from kafka 3.5 to 3.6=20
> -------------------------------------------------------------------------=
-----------------------------------------------
>
>                 Key: KAFKA-16692
>                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-16692
