             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Task
    Affects Versions: 3.7.0
            Reporter: mooner


There is a vulnerability (CVE-2024-29025) in the passive dependency software Netty used by Kafka, which has been fixed in version 4.1.108.Final.

There is also a vulnerability (CVE-2024-22201) in the passive dependency software Jetty, which has been fixed in version 9.4.54.v20240208.

When will Kafka upgrade the versions of Netty and Jetty to fix these two vulnerabilities?

Reference website:

https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2024-29025

https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2024-22201



