    Fix Version/s: 3.8.0
                   3.7.1
         Assignee: David Jacot
       Resolution: Fixed

> Unstable committed offsets after triggering commits where metadata for so=
me partitions are over the limit
> -------------------------------------------------------------------------=
--------------------------------
>
>                 Key: KAFKA-16371
>                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-16371
