{{ConnectSchema.expectedClassesFor}} sometimes will throw an NPE as part of=
 a call to an SMT chain.=C2=A0 Stack trace snippet:

{{at com.github.momenttechnology.kafka.connect.transforms.MomentFlatten.app=
ly(MomentFlatten.java:84)}}
