ll{}}}, the subsequent call to {{Schema#name()}} at o.a.k.connect.data.Conn=
ectSchema:268 throws an NPE.

The strange thing that we have observed is that this doesn't always happen;=
 *sometimes* the struct's schema is found and sometimes it is not. We have =
been unable to determine the root cause, but have constructed a test that r=
eplicates the problem as observed (see attachment).

In our case we have worked around the issue with the aforementioned sub-cla=
ss of {{{}Flatten{}}}, catching and logging the NPE on that specific use-ca=
se.



